{"meetingId": "78", "tickets": [
{"title": "Organize estate settlement planning-side file", "text": "Organize a planning-side file for Lydia Cloudpuddle separating probate assets, beneficiary assets, estate professionals, family decision points, and household planning impacts. Lydia is co-executor with Calvin Velvetreed of Nora Velvetreed's estate, with probate handled by Sienna Bramblequill of Paper Otter Legal.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-08", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Lydia asked Apricot Compass Advisory to organize a planning-side file separating probate assets, beneficiary assets, estate professionals, family decision points, and household planning impacts. The agreed follow-up is to organize that file by 2025-08-08."},
{"title": "Resolve Missing Signature Packet", "text": "Use this workflow when a document packet cannot be submitted or finalized because one or more required signatures, initials, dates, attestations, or delivery acknowledgments are missing. Confirm the specific signature gap, contact the appropriate signer using approved communication channels, document the outreach, and verify the corrected packet before submission. Velvet Acorn Custody requires a certified death certificate, letters of authority, and a beneficiary claim packet before establishing Lydia Cloudpuddle's inherited IRA registration; Lydia currently has only a photocopy of the death certificate and an unsigned draft claim form.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-08-01", "assigneeId": "0d61606d-603e-57bf-ab9b-0ca9eccca1b8", "templateId": "e8f5e053-ae21-5df8-b21f-3b72945a5371", "subTasks": [{"title": "Identify the exact signature deficiency", "text": "Review the packet and note each missing item: signer role, document name, page or section, required signature/initial/date, and whether a witness, notary, spouse, trustee, or authorized representative is also required. The draft beneficiary claim form for Lydia Cloudpuddle's inherited IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody is unsigned, and the death certificate is only a photocopy rather than certified.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "0d61606d-603e-57bf-ab9b-0ca9eccca1b8", "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Confirm follow-up approach with advisory team", "text": "Determine whether the item can be corrected electronically, requires wet ink, or needs a new form. If the missing signature affects advice, authorization, ownership, or beneficiary instructions, confirm the next step with the advisor before contacting the signer.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "bc4c93c5-32d9-5b85-8582-1740c5c570dd", "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Send signer outreach with clear instructions", "text": "Contact the signer using placeholders for [client/signer name], [document name], [signature location], [return method], and [support contact]. Include only the minimum necessary document details and avoid sending sensitive information through unapproved channels.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "0d61606d-603e-57bf-ab9b-0ca9eccca1b8", "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Validate corrected packet and record completion", "text": "After the corrected document is received, verify all required signatures and dates are present, save the final version to the appropriate client record, update the task notes with evidence collected, and route the packet for submission or advisor review as needed.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "a1a32255-45db-5876-a51d-f94935e71b05", "dueDate": null}], "evidence": "Velvet Acorn Custody requires a certified death certificate, letters of authority, and a beneficiary claim packet before establishing Lydia’s inherited IRA registration; Lydia only has a photocopy of the death certificate and an unsigned draft claim form. The agreed follow-up is to address the claim-packet requirements by 2025-08-01."},
{"title": "Resolve Tin Sparrow account ownership treatment", "text": "Resolve the ownership treatment of the Tin Sparrow Investments brokerage account (estimated $275,000) in Nora Velvetreed's estate before estate accounting can be finalized. The statement shows a transfer-on-death registration naming Lydia Cloudpuddle and Calvin Velvetreed, while Paper Otter Legal's preliminary inventory lists it as a probate asset.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-15", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The Tin Sparrow Investments statement shows a transfer-on-death registration naming Lydia and Calvin, while Paper Otter Legal’s preliminary inventory lists the same brokerage account as a probate asset. The ownership treatment remains unresolved before estate accounting can be finalized, with follow-up needed by 2025-08-15."},
{"title": "Prepare estate cash-flow calendar for condominium", "text": "Prepare a practical calendar for Lydia Cloudpuddle showing recurring expenses for Nora Velvetreed's condominium (county estimate $620,000, no mortgage), likely sale-preparation costs, estate-paid items, and any personal advances by the co-executors. Lydia will use it to coordinate fairly with Calvin Velvetreed.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-06", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Lydia requested a practical calendar showing recurring condominium expenses, likely sale-preparation costs, estate-paid items, and any personal advances by the co-executors so she can coordinate fairly with Calvin. The agreed follow-up is to prepare that calendar by 2025-08-06."},
{"title": "Review inherited IRA distribution choices", "text": "Complete a planning review for Lydia Cloudpuddle of available inherited IRA distribution approaches for the traditional IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody (estimated $410,000), estimated taxable income effects, withholding preferences, and how different withdrawal pacing would interact with her planned retirement from Copper Firefly Design at age 62. Review is needed before she signs account setup instructions.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-09-05", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Lydia wants a planning review of available inherited IRA distribution approaches, estimated taxable income effects, withholding preferences, and how different withdrawal pacing would interact with her planned retirement timing before she signs account setup instructions. The agreed follow-up is to complete that review by 2025-09-05."},
{"title": "Perform recurring beneficiary designation review", "text": "At each annual review cycle, and after any reported major life event, confirm whether beneficiary designations should be reviewed for retirement accounts, insurance policies, transfer-on-death registrations, and education accounts. Document the date of the last confirmed beneficiary review, evidence available, discrepancies found, and any forms or custodian steps needed. Lydia Cloudpuddle's older employer 401(k) beneficiary record names only Mara Cloudpuddle as contingent beneficiary while advisory records for her IRA name both children; Lydia's current intent is equal treatment of Mara and Theo across retirement assets.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-08-22", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "c0849ab3-1ea7-5ae4-8eb0-302abcb9d836", "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Mira’s review found that Lydia’s older employer 401(k) beneficiary record names only Mara as contingent beneficiary, while the advisory records for Lydia’s IRA name both children; Lydia said her current intent is equal treatment of Mara and Theo across retirement assets. The agreed follow-up is to address the beneficiary alignment by 2025-08-22."},
{"title": "Obtain estate counsel communication authorization", "text": "Obtain an authorization allowing Sienna Bramblequill of Paper Otter Legal to discuss asset values, beneficiary registrations, basis information, and liquidity questions with Apricot Compass Advisory and Clockwork Clover Tax. The current advisory file for Lydia Cloudpuddle does not include an authorization covering estate counsel.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-07-30", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Sienna requested permission to discuss asset values, beneficiary registrations, basis information, and liquidity questions with Apricot Compass Advisory and Clockwork Clover Tax; the current advisory file does not include an authorization covering estate counsel. The agreed follow-up is to obtain the authorization by 2025-07-30."},
{"title": "Correct Velvet Acorn inherited account name", "text": "Address the name correction with Velvet Acorn Custody, which opened the service record under Lydia Velvetreed even though Lydia Cloudpuddle's identification and advisory records use Lydia Cloudpuddle. The mismatch may prevent acceptance of inherited account paperwork unless the custodian corrects the registration workflow.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-04", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Velvet Acorn Custody opened the service record under Lydia Velvetreed even though Lydia’s identification and advisory records use Lydia Cloudpuddle. The mismatch may prevent acceptance of inherited account paperwork unless the custodian corrects the registration workflow, and the agreed follow-up is to address the name correction by 2025-08-04."}
]}
